  "referenceNumber": "MYA0001",
  "remarks": "\nBrigadier General Than Oo, Commander of the 99th Light Infantry Division of the Myanmar Army. Responsible for the repression of the civilian population, actions that threaten the peace, stability or security of Myanmar and serious human rights violations committed against the Rohingya population in Rakhine state. These include unlawful killings and systematic burning of Rohingya houses and buildings.",
